    description: "Consumer-facing capability behind aijo's \"survey as a first-class PR artifact\": diff two surveys (base vs head) and surface only real structural changes — added / removed / changed nodes, edges, routes, entrypoints. Identity-keyed STRUCTURAL diff (keyed on stable_id / edge identity), NOT a text diff — so it ignores volatile provenance by construction and short-circuits when the two canonical digests match. Read-view + JSON envelope {schema_version, view: \"survey_diff\", ...}.\n\nBeyond G8 / WI-pifaj scope: new aijo-layer work, confirmed absent by the 2026-07-21 G8 verification pass (no diff exists today). Demand-gated on aijo — build when the aijo layer needs it.\n\nBlocked-by: the canonical-digest item (its short-circuit key) and, transitively, the `--reproducible` byte-repro mode (a text-noisy survey makes the diff meaningless)."  # f877
